    ('q-pl90-fib-17', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'listening', 'pte-listening-fib', 'Listening Fill in the Blanks', 'The 1918 flu pandemic', 'You will hear a recording. Type the missing words in each blank.', 'The influenza pandemic of 1918 killed tens of millions of people worldwide. Unusually, many of its victims were healthy young [[b1]] rather than the very old or very young. It became known as Spanish flu, not because it started in Spain, but because Spain was [[b2]] in the First World War and its newspapers reported the outbreak freely, while other countries [[b3]] the news.', 'The influenza pandemic of 1918 killed tens of millions of people worldwide. Unusually, many of its victims were healthy young adults rather than the very old or very young. It became known as Spanish flu, not because it started in Spain, but because Spain was neutral in the First World War and its newspapers reported the outbreak freely, while other countries censored the news.', 7, 120, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "b1", "correctAnswer": "adults"}, {"id": "b2", "correctAnswer": "neutral"}, {"id": "b3", "correctAnswer": "censored"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'The recording says: adults, neutral, censored.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Original practice', 'Listening Fill in the Blanks']::text[], true),
