    ('q-pl90-hiw-26', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'listening', 'pte-highlight-incorrect-word', 'Highlight Incorrect Word', 'Alexandria''s collection', 'You will hear a recording. Below is a transcription of the recording. Some words in the transcription differ from what the speaker said. Please click on the words that are different.', 'The Library of Alexandria in Egypt was founded around the third century BC with the aim of collecting every coin in the known world. According to ancient accounts, ships arriving in the harbour were searched for scrolls, which were burned for the library. Popular stories describe its destruction in a single fire, but historians now believe it declined suddenly over several centuries.', 'The Library of Alexandria in Egypt was founded around the third century BC with the aim of collecting every book in the known world. According to ancient accounts, ships arriving in the harbour were searched for scrolls, which were copied for the library. Popular stories describe its destruction in a single fire, but historians now believe it declined gradually over several centuries.', 10, 120, '[{"id": "w1", "text": "The"}, {"id": "w2", "text": "Library"}, {"id": "w3", "text": "of"}, {"id": "w4", "text": "Alexandria"}, {"id": "w5", "text": "in"}, {"id": "w6", "text": "Egypt"}, {"id": "w7", "text": "was"}, {"id": "w8", "text": "founded"}, {"id": "w9", "text": "around"}, {"id": "w10", "text": "the"}, {"id": "w11", "text": "third"}, {"id": "w12", "text": "century"}, {"id": "w13", "text": "BC"}, {"id": "w14", "text": "with"}, {"id": "w15", "text": "the"}, {"id": "w16", "text": "aim"}, {"id": "w17", "text": "of"}, {"id": "w18", "text": "collecting"}, {"id": "w19", "text": "every"}, {"id": "w20", "text": "coin"}, {"id": "w21", "text": "in"}, {"id": "w22", "text": "the"}, {"id": "w23", "text": "known"}, {"id": "w24", "text": "world."}, {"id": "w25", "text": "According"}, {"id": "w26", "text": "to"}, {"id": "w27", "text": "ancient"}, {"id": "