    ('q-pl90-hiw-32', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'listening', 'pte-highlight-incorrect-word', 'Highlight Incorrect Word', 'Pigeons at war', 'You will hear a recording. Below is a transcription of the recording. Some words in the transcription differ from what the speaker said. Please click on the words that are different.', 'Carrier pigeons were widely used to carry messages during the First World War, because they could fly home silently even when telephone lines were cut. One famous pigeon, Cher Ami, delivered a message in 1918 that helped save a group of trapped American farmers, despite being badly trained on the way.', 'Carrier pigeons were widely used to carry messages during the First World War, because they could fly home quickly even when telephone lines were cut. One famous pigeon, Cher Ami, delivered a message in 1918 that helped save a group of trapped American soldiers, despite being badly wounded on the way.', 10, 120, '[{"id": "w1", "text": "Carrier"}, {"id": "w2", "text": "pigeons"}, {"id": "w3", "text": "were"}, {"id": "w4", "text": "widely"}, {"id": "w5", "text": "used"}, {"id": "w6", "text": "to"}, {"id": "w7", "text": "carry"}, {"id": "w8", "text": "messages"}, {"id": "w9", "text": "during"}, {"id": "w10", "text": "the"}, {"id": "w11", "text": "First"}, {"id": "w12", "text": "World"}, {"id": "w13", "text": "War,"}, {"id": "w14", "text": "because"}, {"id": "w15", "text": "they"}, {"id": "w16", "text": "could"}, {"id": "w17", "text": "fly"}, {"id": "w18", "text": "home"}, {"id": "w19", "text": "silently"}, {"id": "w20", "text": "even"}, {"id": "w21", "text": "when"}, {"id": "w22", "text": "telephone"}, {"id": "w23", "text": "lines"}, {"id": "w24", "text": "were"}, {"id": "w25", "text": "cut."}, {"id": "w26", "text": "One"}, {"id": "w27", "text": "famous"}, {"id": "w28", "text": "pigeon,"}, {"id": "w29", "text": "Cher"}, {"id": "w30", "text": "Ami,"}, {"id": "w31", "text": "delivered"}, {"id": "w32", "text": "a"}, {"id": "w33", "tex